OL,3,AIran referred to UN Security Council
OL,4,Afor nuclear non-compliance
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UN nuclear watchdog has referred
OL,7,FIran to the Security Council for
OL,8,F"non-compliance" with its obligations
OL,9,Funder the non-proliferation treaty -
OL,10,Fthe first such move in 20 years.
OL,12,FThe board of governors of the
OL,13,FInternational Atomic Energy Agency
OL,14,F(IAEA) passed a resolution at a meeting
OL,15,Fin Vienna.
OL,17,FIt cites a lack of information on
OL,18,FIran's nuclear material such as its
OL,19,Fstockpile of highly enriched uranium,
OL,20,Fand the lack of access to nuclear
OL,21,Ffacilities for IAEA inspectors.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
